{"id":"9ca0b12c56d3a795","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-filtered-complex.md","title":"Filtered Complex","display":"df-filtered-complex — Filtered Complex","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-filtered-complex","aliases":["58-df-filtered-complex","Filtered Complex"],"display":"df-filtered-complex — Filtered Complex","depends_on":["[[58-df-chain-complex]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-subgroup]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-filtered-complex"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-filtered-complex</span><span>Filtered Complex</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-filtered-complex — Filtered Complex"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c3537edf2017d84e\" href=\"?note=c3537edf2017d84e\" title=\"58-df-chain-complex\">58-df-chain-complex</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"59685d062adf2748\" href=\"?note=59685d062adf2748\" title=\"58-df-subgroup\">58-df-subgroup</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,+,\\partial\\in V^{\\mathbb Z}\">\\(C,+,\\partial\\in V^{\\mathbb Z}\\)</span> (chain-complex carriers, operations, and boundary maps)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in(V^{\\mathbb Z})^{\\mathbb Z}\">\\(F\\in(V^{\\mathbb Z})^{\\mathbb Z}\\)</span> (integer-indexed family of graded subgroup carriers)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C,+,\\partial)\">\\(\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C,+,\\partial)\\)</span> (chain-complex predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S\\)</span> (subgroup predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FilteredComplex}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FilteredComplex}_S\\)</span> (filtered-complex predicate defined in this file)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AssociatedGradedComponent}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AssociatedGradedComponent}_S\\)</span> (quotient-carrier predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}filtered\\text{-}complex}\\vdash\\mathrm{FilteredComplex}_S(C,+,\\partial,F)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C,+,\\partial)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}(F))\\land\\forall p\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(F(p),\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}(F(p)))\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(F(p)(n),C(n),+(n))\\land F(p)(n)\\subseteq F(p+1)(n)\\land\\partial(n)[F(p)(n)]\\subseteq F(p)(n-1)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}filtered\\text{-}complex}\\vdash\\mathrm{FilteredComplex}_S(C,+,\\partial,F)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ChainComplex}_S(C,+,\\partial)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}(F))\\land\\forall p\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(F(p),\\mathbb Z,\\operatorname{ran}(F(p)))\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(F(p)(n),C(n),+(n))\\land F(p)(n)\\subseteq F(p+1)(n)\\land\\partial(n)[F(p)(n)]\\subseteq F(p)(n-1)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}filtered\\text{-}complex\\text{-}graded}\\vdash\\mathrm{AssociatedGradedComponent}_S(Q,C,+,\\partial,F,p,n)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{FilteredComplex}_S(C,+,\\partial,F)\\land p,n\\in\\mathbb Z\\land Q=\\Bigl\\{\\{y\\in F(p)(n):\\exists h\\in F(p-1)(n)\\;y=+(n)(\\langle x,h\\rangle)\\}:x\\in F(p)(n)\\Bigr\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}filtered\\text{-}complex\\text{-}graded}\\vdash\\mathrm{AssociatedGradedComponent}_S(Q,C,+,\\partial,F,p,n)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{FilteredComplex}_S(C,+,\\partial,F)\\land p,n\\in\\mathbb Z\\land Q=\\Bigl\\{\\{y\\in F(p)(n):\\exists h\\in F(p-1)(n)\\;y=+(n)(\\langle x,h\\rangle)\\}:x\\in F(p)(n)\\Bigr\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Each filtration stage is now a graded family of subgroups preserved by the boundary, rather than a subset of the set-coded family <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The associated graded component is the explicit coset carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_pC_n/F_{p-1}C_n\">\\(F_pC_n/F_{p-1}C_n\\)</span>; spectral-sequence pages are downstream constructions, not clauses of this definition.</li>\n<li>Leray-Serre: homology of total space from fiber and base via spectral sequence</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>McCleary, A User's Guide to Spectral Sequences</li>\n<li>Bott and Tu, Differential Forms in Algebraic Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-chain-complex","status":"resolved","id":"c3537edf2017d84e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-chain-complex]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","